  "body": "Part of #290 (design decisions D1-D10 in its research comment).\n\nDepends on: #532, #533.\n\nMachine page shows the wire keys and the condition table, with absent values shown as \"not stated\". The wire contour op page follows the op-page tab pattern. Every edit is a command (Everything Is a Command).\n\n**Done means:** a wire machine and a 2-axis contour can be set up, edited and undone in the GUI. Pinned by a ui event test.",
